pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 수업시간표 : 영어회화Ⅰ 외 31강좌 (붙임 참조)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 수학희망자 추천기한 : 2012. 5. 18.(금)까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">(※ 학번부여 예정일 : 2012. 5. 25.(금))</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">4. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">수강신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012. 5. 29.(화) ~ 2012. 5. 31.(목)</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청가능 학점 : 6학점까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수강신청 방법 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 안동대학교 홈페이지【종합정보시스템】에 접속</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- ID : 안동대에서 부여한 학번 / PW : 자신의 주민등록번호 뒷자리</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 왼쪽 메뉴〔수강관리-계절학기 수강신청〕 개설교과목 클릭</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">5. 폐강과목 조회</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012. 6. 1.(금) 홈페이지 공지사항에 공고(예정)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 수강신청 인원 10명 미만일 경우 폐강됨</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수강변경 기간(폐강과목 신청자에 한함) : 2012. 6. 4.(월) ~ 2012. 6. 5.(화)(2일간)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">6. 수강료 납부</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">납부기간</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012. 6. 8.(금) ~ 2012. 6. 12.(화) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부금액 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">학점당 35,000원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">(단, 영어, 컴퓨터 교과목은 시간당 35,000원)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">【시간당 강좌 : 영어회화Ⅰ, 영어회화Ⅱ】</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 납부방법 : 안동대학교 홈페이지【종합정보시스템】에서 등록금고지서 출력 ⇒ 학생별 가상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">계좌로 납부하거나, 신한은행 안동대학교 출장소에서 납부 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle1\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 등록금의 반환은 폐강된 경우를 제외하고는 일체 반환하지 않음</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 납부</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">기</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">간에 수강료를 납부하지 않으면 수강신청한 교과목은 삭제되며, 이후 수강</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">신</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">청 불가함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">7. 성적처리</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">가. 학생이 취득한 성적은 본교의 학칙, 학사운영 규정에 따라 처리함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 성적은 100점 만점의 실점수로 환산하여 소속 대학교로 일괄 송부함</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 성적확인 및 정정기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2012. 7. 23.(월) ~ 2012. 7. 24.(화)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 성적통보(예정) : 2012. 7. 23.(월)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=